<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Things on the way serve to expose</l><l>Natural ability;</l><l>My stubborn heart knows not Your will,</l><l>With God wrestles tirelessly.</l><l>Your hand touched my stubborn places,</l><l>Transformed, to obed’ient be;</l><l>Your word reveals, leads me to know:</l><l>“My life-long Shepherd is Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>To build Your house, no more we roam,</l><l>God’s dream’s fixed upon our soul;</l><l>Cast off all weights, and run the race,</l><l>The building’s our only goal.</l><l>Pattern cheers, and we respond, renewed;</l><l>As faith’s footsteps we accept,</l><l>Follow the Lamb unto the end,</l><l>That Holy City with You.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
